# Composer

```bash
composer init
composer require monolog/monolog
composer require --dev phpunit/phpunit
composer dump-autoload -o
```

## composer.json (фрагмент)

```json
{
  "name": "demo/php-learning",
  "require": {
    "php": "^8.3",
    "monolog/monolog": "^3.0"
  },
  "require-dev": {
    "phpunit/phpunit": "^11.0"
  },
  "autoload": {
    "psr-4": {
      "App\\": "src/"
    }
  }
}
```

## Полезные команды

| Команда | Действие |
|---------|----------|
| `composer update` | обновить зависимости |
| `composer show` | список пакетов |
| `composer outdated` | устаревшие версии |
